# PROJECT: WHOLESALE BUSINESS MANAGEMENT APPLICATION
## Complete Product Requirements and Development Specification

### 1. ROLE AND PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior Android application developer, full-stack software architect, database engineer, UI/UX designer, and business management software specialist.

Develop a complete, production-ready Wholesale Business Management Application for small and medium-sized wholesale businesses in India.

The application should replace traditional handwritten bills, customer notebooks, manual order books, and physical payment records.

The application must help business owners manage their complete wholesale business from one mobile application.

### Primary objectives

- Manage customers and their complete history.
- Manage products and flexible selling options.
- Create professional bills.
- Record prepaid and postpaid transactions.
- Track customer outstanding balances.
- Collect orders manually through sales executives.
- Manage inventory and stock.
- Manage suppliers and purchases.
- Maintain complete payment history.
- Generate printable invoices and customer statements.
- Support multiple employees.
- Work without internet using local mobile storage.

The application must be extremely simple for non-technical users, including older shop owners.

Prioritize usability, speed, flexibility, and financial accuracy.

