Category: Flour.

Selling Option 1:

- Variety Name: Loose KG.
- Selling Unit: KG.
- Price: ₹110 per KG.
- Minimum Stock: 10 KG.

Selling Option 2:

- Variety Name: 25 KG Bag.
- Selling Unit: Bag.
