# 13. PAYMENT STATUS – PREPAID AND POSTPAID

Keep payment entry simple.

Do not ask for payment app connections or bank details.

Provide two primary payment statuses.

### Prepaid

The customer has already paid.

Allow entering the amount received.

### Postpaid

The customer will pay later.

Allow entering an amount already received, including partial payment.

Automatically calculate:

Remaining Balance = Total Bill Amount - Amount Paid.

Display:

- Total Bill Amount.
- Amount Paid.
- Remaining Balance.
- Payment Status.

Support partial payments and payments made later.

All payments must be manually entered.

Do not require a payment method during bill creation.

