### A4 four-bill printing

Create a dedicated A4 template divided into four equal bill sections.

When the user selects four copies, print four identical versions of the same bill on one A4 sheet.

All four sections must contain:

- Same invoice number.
- Same customer details.
- Same products.
- Same quantities.
- Same rates.
- Same total amount.
- Same payment information.

Do not print labels such as:

- Original.
- Duplicate.
- Triplicate.
- Copy.

All four bills must be identical without copy-identification text.

Provide:

- One copy.
- Two copies.
- Four copies.

Support subtle cutting guides between sections.

Provide a separate full-page A4 printing option.

If an invoice contains too many products, use a continuation page or full-page format rather than making the text unreadably small.

