# FINAL PRODUCT VISION

Build a complete, simple, reliable, and flexible Wholesale Business Management Application for Indian wholesale businesses.

The business owner must be able to manage customers, products, product selling options, orders, bills, payments, inventory, employees, suppliers, and business reports from one Android mobile application.

The most important functionality is flexible product selling.

One product must be sellable in KG, Bags, Packets, Boxes, Pieces, and other configured units, with independent prices for each selling option.

During product creation, the owner defines the selling options, package contents, prices, and minimum stock.

During billing, the employee selects the product, selects how it is being sold, enters the quantity, and the application automatically calculates the amount.

The application must maintain complete customer purchase and payment history.

All bills and customer statements must be printable and customizable.

Four identical bills must fit on one A4 sheet without Original or Duplicate labels.

The application must work offline using local mobile storage.

English and Telugu must be fully supported, with optional Hindi support.

Business information can be entered in English, Telugu, or both.

The application must be easy enough for older Telugu-speaking shop owners and powerful enough for multiple employees.

**Build this as a real-world business application, prioritizing simplicity, flexibility, accurate calculations, reliable local storage, and professional printing.**